<title>NEW ZEALAND: Metropolitan Lifecare raises yr profit.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Lifecare raises yr profit.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    3.31 vs 0.53</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    6.3 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.0 vs 0.5</p>
<p>    Total div for yr (cents)	   3.0 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     34.70 vs 27.0</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 3.30 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Tax			     debit 0.22 vs credit 0.18</p>
<p>    Equity earnings		     0.23 vs loss 0.6</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   56.95 vs 52.2</p>
<p>Dividend carries nil imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date May 9</p>
<p>Reg date May 2</p>
<p>    Ex div   May 5</p>
<p>Note - Metropolitan Lifecare Group Ltd is a retirement village and healthcare provider.</p>
<p>Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
